  "name": null,
  "problem": "A survey of adult citizens of a certain country showed that $90%$ of all people with a bachelor's degree speak at least one foreign language. Overall, $63%$ of the adult population speaks a foreign language, and $31%$ of the adult ​population has a bachelor's degree. If a person who speaks a foreign language is selected at random, what is the probability of them having a bachelor's degree? Express your answer as a percentage to the nearest percent.",
