ay=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>31</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> of the adult ​population has a bachelor's degree. If a person who speaks a foreign language is selected at random, what is the probability of them having a bachelor's degree? Express your answer as a percentage to the nearest percent.</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Tue, Oct 13th @ 12:50 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:22</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
